task('044','040','Tune repeatable capture settings','Dev',ALL_VIDEOS,'Connect each start to the existing repeatable Editor recording workflow. This task is derived from project workflow guidance rather than a new requirement in the creative brief.',['Each start resets to a known state.','A repeated take uses the same seed and timing.','Creators can select the next variant without duplicating scenes.'],['flow'],['039','043'],1);
